# TypeScript/JavaScript Security

## Secret Management

```typescript
// NEVER: hardcoded secrets
const apiKey = "sk-proj-xxxxx"

// ALWAYS: environment variables — in this repo, only via `src/env.ts`
import { env } from '@/env'
const token = env.GITHUB_TOKEN
```

Never read raw `process.env` outside `src/env.ts`. Secrets must never appear in logs — see
`src/lib/safeLog.ts` for the redaction list.
